      {
        "type": "paragraph",
        "children": [
          {
            "type": "text",
            "value": "Accessibility is a top priority for Base UI.\nBase UI components handle many complex accessibility details including ARIA attributes, role attributes, pointer interactions, keyboard navigation, and focus management.\nThe goal is to provide an accessible user experience out of the box, with intuitive APIs for configuration.",
            "position": {
              "start": {
                "line": 9,
                "column": 1,
                "offset": 239
              },
              "end": {
